	<section_number>46.2-902</section_number>
	<catch_line>Leaving scene of accident when directed to do so by officer</catch_line>
	<text>
		A person shall leave the scene of a traffic accident when directed to do so by a law-enforcement officer.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-258; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-251; 1989, c. 727.</history>
